## Why This Is Asked
Real-world enterprise risk monitoring requires multilingual understanding with code-switching while preserving privacy. It also tests ability to design federated updates, per-tenant governance, and secure rollback in production.

## Key Concepts
- Federated learning and differential privacy for cross-tenant training
- Multilingual handling with code-switching and low-resource languages
- Real-time alerting vs. post-hoc review pipeline
- Explainability and per-message risk scoring
- Drift detection and secure rollout/rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
function riskScore(tokens, model) {
  // placeholder: real inference would run a lightweight classifier
  // returns 0..1 risk probability for the message
  const score = model.predict(tokens);
  return Math.max(0, Math.min(1, score));
}
```

